{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"firstSight","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"text","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ItemTrait","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ItemTrait","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto9ItemTraitV"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"text","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The first-sight paragraph."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The first-sight trait.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ContainersDoorsAndLocks","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/WritingRules"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"It stands in for whichever stock listing sentence the item would otherwise","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"have earned, wherever the room lists it: on the floor, on a surface, or one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"level down inside a container. So a thing that starts folded inside another","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"thing announces itself in its own words rather than through","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“In the boat is a tan label.”"}],"type":"emphasis"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"One level is where that stops. A room description lists what stands in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"room and what those things hold, and goes no deeper, so this trait on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"something the map buries two levels down has nowhere to print — the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bootstrap warns rather than leaving the line to read as live.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"room listing"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" is the whole of its scope. OPEN, SEARCH and INVENTORY","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"enumerate contents into one sentence — “Opening the box reveals a violin.” —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"where a room description composes paragraphs, so those name the thing rather","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"than describing it and this line does not reach them.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"On an ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Actor"},{"text":" the same trait is the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"standing presence line"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" (ZIL’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"LDESC role): printed on every look, never worn off by handling — people","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"aren’t props.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Describing-Entities","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/LocationTrait","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ItemTrait","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/adjectives(_:)","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/synonyms(_:)","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/dark","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/alwaysDescribed","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/alwaysListed","d